d1f04fa8e (1)(2).png", "id": "1793295041680481", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499308699_1793295045013814_7185863093506872466_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nVbyaZeBUlgQ7kNvwHeA9ye&_nc_oc=AdrEEj1CXcvj-sQnP4-L6Yt9VJ3zKPEcqVkVUok2ZS62iPTZITNMFalJqysDBbrpXnA&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQLCLD4yugEhEFfwhfpB8BpxjHSbAOEIWjGTAt8qmIzb9g&oe=6AABE21A"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "auraplay-cover-landscape-2560x1440-v2.png", "id": "1572402754640791", "uri": "https://scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/491823366_1572402761307457_5157960825411766997_n.png?_nc_cat=105&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=sepK7JdOjPAQ7kNvwHBCEdL&_nc_oc=AdoxrfFt2I9wQRWFhNEbvbh0eyBbIFLpBeoaQ42iKf37EfMlz0JOknqCvMsU9rqe1Gs&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-iad3-2.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQK4nbkx1Ncvd19k2TonlMl8Awizr6er5QbKNR8peh7K5Q&oe=6AABE0CA"}, "display_name": "AuraPlay VR Player", "keywords": ["cinema", "movies", "Plex", "3D", "streaming"], "long_description": "**Key Features:**\n\n**NEW - Full Blu-ray 3D (MVC):** Play MKV Blu-ray-3D rips at full 1080p per eye - real Blu-ray 3D, not half-res SBS. Stream from your PC over AuraLink or play locally, with soundtrack, spatial audio, subtitles (CC), seek and auto-resume.\n\n**Stream from NAS or PC (SMB & DLNA):** Play from a network share or media server (Plex, UMS) over Wi-Fi.\n\n**AuraLink Companion App:** One-click PC streaming and 2D to 3D conversion - free at auraplayvr.com.\n\n**Automatic Subtitles:** An .srt beside your film loads itself; embedded subs too.\n\n**Flat or Curved Screen:** Place a giant display anywhere and wrap it around you. Fine-tune with the new Sharpness control.\n\n**Home Cinema, Luxury Auditorium & IMAX:** Glide into any seat as the lights dim.\n\n**Lock the Screen:** Pin it so a nudge can't move it mid-film.\n\n**Plays Your Library:** MP4, MKV, AVI, MOV with native aspect ratios, subtitles and auto-resume.\n\n**True 3D:** Full Blu-ray 3D (MVC), plus Side-by-Side and Over-Under - sharp, strain-free depth.\n\n**Immersive 180\u00b0 & 360\u00b0 VR Video:** Auto-detects from the filename, with Flat/180\u00b0/360\u00b0, one-tap Re-center and 3D support.\n\n**Reactive AuraLight:** Ambient room glow that samples the film's colours live; adjustable Room Illumination.\n\n**Spatial Audio:** Sound stays locked to the screen as you turn your head.\n\n**Spatial UI:** Grab and float controls anywhere, with auto-fading bars.\n\nNo subscriptions. No accounts. No telemetry.", "short_description": "Your movies deserve a cinema, not a flat rectangle. AuraPlay turns your Quest 3 into a spatial theatre - a screen as big as you want, floating in your real room or inside custom 3D environments. Now with full-resolution Blu-ray 3D (MVC): play or stream your 3D rips at true 1080p per eye. Lean, native and fast for your whole 2D and 3D collection - with reactive room lighting and spatial audio."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://auraplayvr.com/privacy/", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "David McGuinness", "support_website_url": "https://auraplayvr.com/#support", "website_url": "https://auraplayvr.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "362692211442873", "context_category": "APPS"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "434961926215971"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["SINGLE_USER"], "id": "2133305930934464"}, "review_messages": []}]}, "cover_square_image": {"uri": "ht